flowchart LR
    DEV([Developer]) --> PR[GitHub Pull Request]
    PR --> CI[GitHub Actions]

    subgraph QUALITY[Quality and Security Gates]
        TEST[Pytest + Ruff]
        SAST[Bandit SAST]
        SCA[OWASP Dependency-Check]
        TRIVY[Trivy Image Scan]
    end

    CI --> TEST
    CI --> SAST
    CI --> SCA
    TEST --> IMAGE[Multi-stage Docker Image]
    SAST --> IMAGE
    SCA --> IMAGE
    IMAGE --> TRIVY
    TRIVY --> REG[(Docker Hub Registry)]

    subgraph K8S[Kubernetes: securepipeline namespace]
        DEPLOY[Deployment x2]
        SERVICE[ClusterIP Service]
        INGRESS[Ingress + TLS]
        POLICY[RBAC + NetworkPolicy]
        PROBES[Startup + Readiness + Liveness]
    end

    REG --> DEPLOY
    DEPLOY --> SERVICE
    SERVICE --> INGRESS
    DEPLOY --- POLICY
    DEPLOY --- PROBES

    subgraph OBS[Observability]
        PROM[Prometheus]
        GRAF[Grafana]
        LOKI[Loki]
        PROMTAIL[Promtail]
    end

    SERVICE --> PROM
    PROM --> GRAF
    DEPLOY --> PROMTAIL
    PROMTAIL --> LOKI
    LOKI --> GRAF

